{"job_id":"F-fa2b4222504cd321b30d","family_id":"F-fa2b4222504cd321b30d","title":"직능인 경제활동 지원에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":18,"target_id":"db13a75627208656cbc297dc24a267fc784e7cba749ac7846a681603158eed26","source_hash":"c1c6240a053f99ec76b2a8e821778f91703994a6f2f88700bf3d429bda6ddecf","text":"支持技术工人经济活动的法案"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":94,"target_id":"a3a69fd899e570eb2ff8c1971b1da8700639fec60621f6bd988622c0d18888dd","source_hash":"482dfa41ffb86cab03948328bf030e0b935f6ecf05986500d7cda3eb77cfc7a1","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是通过促进专业人士意识的改革和使新知识、新技术在经济活动中得到应用，为实现福利社会和发展国民经济做出贡献。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":94,"end":275,"target_id":"ef0343f4c39fda37a54de1d06aba1d27b6f518a227df016ab103e24eed006a68","source_hash":"294e2ad9ba6d0845ab5c0da8e32974f02cdc17504d79bdf7a961fc1e0d5f1226","text":"第二条（定义）本法中使用的术语含义如下。\n1.“专业人士”是指在职业过程中具备履行专业职责的能力，并在专门的专业领域参与经济活动的人。\n2。“专业组织”一词是指由专业人士组成，为在各个专业领域开展活动而成立的组织，符合总统令规定的标准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":275,"end":363,"target_id":"d2bf7986d3c410411a2e7d8155e89498ac4797d39261e7e2d17ac79f25ebf3e9","source_hash":"4048fa79faec1956d1e29c1706c1c4d776d4eda65784f4390ac79397ee038fc0","text":"第三条（专业人士节）政府可以设立专业人士节，以提高公众对专业人士经济活动重要性的认识，并进一步促进专业人士从事经济活动的积极性。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":363,"end":767,"target_id":"390822cf4d62439631d8eb219e8ad98cfd50ce6b853efeeff5ac631b4b9efd3b","source_hash":"eb7a2175bdf0eea9c31840aae7770d57d7c175bfea532ac6d5d890a74039f17b","text":"第四条（专业组织联合会等的设立）\n① 为促进专业人士和专业组织的共同利益和健康发展，并协助便利专业人士的经济活动，可以成立专业组织联合会（以下简称“联合会”）。\n② 该联盟应为法人实体。\n③ 按照其章程规定，联合会的总部应设在首尔市，并可在必要时设立分会和分支机构。\n④ 任何拟成立协会的人员，均应按照总统令的规定，向内政安全部长提交公司章程及其他必要文件，并获得成立批准。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n⑤ 协会通过在其主要办事处所在地注册成立。\n⑥ 关于联合会章程内容、运作方式等必要事项，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":767,"end":1026,"target_id":"5566c2233f4fd9fdd32306859b7f88d7cea587b9c0c07913ee5b8a836bf1927e","source_hash":"915d9a6d622eab4d9f8fcef1f1567eb1fc7b4a28a5ada9b4382817da66040500","text":"第五条（联邦的职责）联邦应当履行下列各款规定的职责。\n1. 专业人员意识改革及新知识和技术人才培养的教育培训\n2. 提供专业人士信息\n3. 专业人士经济活动现状及条件调查\n4. 海外培训以提升专业资格\n5. 各职能组织间公共利益项目的整合与协调\n6. 促进和发展专业组织的政策制定与支持\n7. 与国外专业组织的合作\n8. 由州或地方政府委托的项目\n9. 促进技术工人经济活动的其他项目\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1026,"end":1127,"target_id":"9257c8948c8a5076b2de9194b73b889a229e78524b612609e85cb98aea887795","source_hash":"4450a5a2b955e9cae2afeb118cbd4495c375144f9feb8b1f9456dbd96d766943","text":"第六条（设立专业人士综合支援中心）联合会可设立专业人士综合支援中心，提供信息、教育、培训、咨询等各种服务，积极促进专业人士的经济活动。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1127,"end":1194,"target_id":"fe05fba28105d7a2dc83a5ab4b177b7d5cf2515ab256143e4721cf1740812662","source_hash":"ce1460bda1eb115892515cf4db29bece27777334e39d8788e222348a615010fd","text":"第七条（《民法》的适用）除本法对联邦另有规定外，《民法》中关于法人团体的规定，应当比照适用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1194,"end":1266,"target_id":"75db3923485096dc4f14f5967b98a0adea0ebe9ac7abfc3bf0bfad8dd7e5d946","source_hash":"97493bd56ac06fdad64a8a9f515431e424763d314e7da5414c2ff66190220b61","text":"第八条（奖励）政府可以向在专业人士的经济活动和社会福利实现方面表现出杰出功绩或起到榜样作用的人颁发奖励。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1266,"end":1461,"target_id":"9610ec940f1bad809d81e949059e4291cf378ab5c90cc2760b31337f23d1100c","source_hash":"26446be0c07e3d839fb208cfe32792b34cde12707003a454e91a4ebfe4a29223","text":"第九条（指导和监督）\n① 内政安全部长可对联邦事务提供指导和监督。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n② 如内政安全部长认为有必要根据第1款进行指导和监督，可要求联邦政府提交必要文件等。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1461,"end":1512,"target_id":"9420861d09da63d4e73753d777b388d4b18e40e3e100bce2cf9ae307759a4bcb","source_hash":"9b65b6d423b72deb22e6cf83d93665d58e5ab089114abdcf9ca89767e1714ddd","text":"补充规定 <第7202号，2004年3月22日>\n\n本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1512,"end":1542,"target_id":"8acdcf2902c09cbb8218c920d68a35bc98b554739fd21c74aeb0086be9f6c5ae","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1542,"end":1674,"target_id":"de748281b17ae82378d014632612c6c7b8e891028d5f7e32e6eb77c229841fca","source_hash":"1ca02d13fb5edf878712dfb619aa64f3827cf01b2c30f77de153b227f65b6f25","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据补充条例第六条修正的、在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律部分，自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1674,"end":1691,"target_id":"2a22c0496e83c6bd2969342fb16cd2d20ef5030982a6e800c34f02279a1ff9e6","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1691,"end":1844,"target_id":"5c7913febcdb10987e6e673d780d7999b133ac12041bf39c0f5f17892766f9bd","source_hash":"7008e5ef3e9672965755fdb444a60a846005da6dcd5e7f482d305dbbda75b01d","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）① 至<231> 已删除\n\n  《支持专业人士经济活动法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第 4 条第 4 款和第 9 条第 1 款和第 2 款中，“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“内政和安全部长”。\n\n  <233> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1844,"end":1852,"target_id":"f7f6eb109e1169a981d2b3183a833d08626e471e0e86cb5100aadc110a73efc9","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1852,"end":1896,"target_id":"7ab4da97afd82adb6e7afc9fcf5d23e90cc292584f7b9f9b64d12d84459378d2","source_hash":"908189df5e869881c3445e023fb732d1bdcee6fe06b03acd47c8124c781f3865","text":"补充规定 <第10740号，2011年5月30日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1896,"end":1927,"target_id":"1a725d06f0df8a8ce91dcc5e4335265b7f5cebcdfdace8c12a836bb424552d4b","source_hash":"884b1766aaddfed62f208e70764e5d43694b510475476512e06be6a0808c47af","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第11690号法案，2013年3月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1927,"end":1966,"target_id":"fdc3839746057370761a9455f2b4c0eb6f4e3df1669743e4ee389b51554cf843","source_hash":"11264c491a84d09dc371820c68fae870846004c0353283ed56de4b9c8d25c060","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n  ② 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1966,"end":1983,"target_id":"2d58ff354ba7199ff60d99cb9eda238429b88486d5f4b6a90db2e773ec92538c","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1983,"end":2136,"target_id":"ce4b38e211cd9b4c830431e73c57118efd1ecac39c435b8f24f6182f49456def","source_hash":"a2f59f16649f1eeba27471fbeadc62e9d966ab0fb9b11d294dc746ed2dbaed47","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<209>款已省略\n\n  《专业人士经济活动支持法》部分修改如下。\n\n  在第4条第4款和第9条第1款和第2款中，“公共行政和安全部长”应改为“安全部长”。\n\n  <211> 至 <710> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2136,"end":2144,"target_id":"225aabb0e08f8b2c8bd56fc05a86fc8dfa20acf57d337464e9f14bea190e9b5a","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2144,"end":2176,"target_id":"11747c16dfa596ea0bf59593ac2a1da08f5e2a00618c2d552597a48ad426f39e","source_hash":"a519f970907d80fc108d8947e92031f10c4d0762155b909dfe5d01543374cb67","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第12844号法案，2014年11月19日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2176,"end":2295,"target_id":"08ecf8aebd584ad95f9551030727798caa9c73a1c1968c57687c3273d0433b54","source_hash":"bb485e539c649e8835d14e3b1b139feba527f204c8e9fced9e458cc082dde578","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第六条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的条款，自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2295,"end":2312,"target_id":"0d6bedc1718950875630426d3c45e4413de846d6a40e3bb99e61a2e0dfb0821b","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2312,"end":2465,"target_id":"cf428407360aca9ac52a5e54b07246ccbd969ae56421ad948c24813b2c78baf2","source_hash":"785acef500a8caea5330c61fa12a13be917c3ec8fe0590ddc8f64dc412a565ec","text":"第六条（其他法律的修正）①至<116>款已省略\n\n  《支持专业人士经济活动法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第 4 条第 4 款和第 9 条第 1 款和第 2 款中，“安全与公共管理部长”应改为“政府行政与内政部长”。\n\n  <118> 至 <258> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2465,"end":2473,"target_id":"1e82bc4f8866517ef0cde971f36ee29b2170a953ff193c0f0f5a03d1023e7293","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2473,"end":2504,"target_id":"64318edb7743d33e4dd7d49a6181bd3cc61698c895d6367a80ea2ec2a3698d61","source_hash":"89d73ef846bf6ff580dd06ac1dbeb869ec8e8f9d99295a602fcc49a474c5bde9","text":"增补（政府组织法）<第14839号法案，2017年7月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2504,"end":2625,"target_id":"9e008723ee82a83e99b563d59407aabadab87b7ebd02e213f326b6e88d8df897","source_hash":"e7f048bc4b0ef4b04a065b53430b00744940cecd919f925823a150f1c549efd1","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第五条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的部分，自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2625,"end":2642,"target_id":"a68edc4130b3b8ece7471a1781272e29af46819907af9f45a2ae1453e15afae9","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2642,"end":2795,"target_id":"43aa5047777858080639b6ab125b421a57c6b225f00ca679fce64e99afd60db2","source_hash":"7b6fa03305ec7ed1b04a2077d777ea5667748abee43d46f21277027967865b2b","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<102>款已省略\n\n  《支持专业人士经济活动法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第 4 条第 4 款和第 9 条第 1 款和第 2 款中，“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“内政和安全部长”。\n\n  <104> 至 <382> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009638-195116-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2795,"end":2801,"target_id":"21dae09bac17b01152a5b19421c70a733269f60aafd3dbc76f2d1c800420f725","source_hash":"0ce5e24c4dce9d4ec9f13e0c399e3542af4b8a8c383f999fb1c0116c332a9c5d","text":"第6条省略"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":22,"target_id":"19b5f20cd28909f679538301f9429bc1954edce361033aa1768f721031e91e5f","source_hash":"acff6bad7947c754b20644a85beb5f0c2da46b9b047c8ec87970a27028dbe053","text":"《支持技术工人经济活动法》实施细则"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":73,"target_id":"eda96cf742f2145f73d16fe63a5ed8873e2101c109a9c66e9a9f9f5da3262dc1","source_hash":"0154bfa71edd5a551bbbcdf0021e44220347aa477f19eb2e3df5f3db552bf21b","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定《支持专业人士经济活动法》所委托的事项以及为实施该法所必需的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":73,"end":273,"target_id":"c84aab379bb49090bcd025729c86f44ddf29e43e3ba3f5647d4ae6302f40d99e","source_hash":"0ac8bed62add755da15f559a800dc57bbaf9809a40687d36b9138baa59d735b1","text":"第2条（专业组织的标准）《支持专业人士经济活动法》（以下简称“本法”）第2条第2款中的“总统令规定的标准”是指下列各款所列的标准。\n1. 它不得是为营利目的而设立和运营的组织。\n2. 它不得是为支持或协助特定政党或特定当选候选人，或传播特定宗教教义而建立或运营的组织。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":273,"end":726,"target_id":"c62b0d2c82129ff21f6dba44a22729b3c480ae4278f3e152d922c0de0080e44b","source_hash":"cf89883c81ba909edd89fc9adf4c51b18cf800f0004cd287e5ac7777c219d046","text":"第三条（成立专业组织联合会所需文件）  凡欲依本法第四条第四款规定申请成立专业组织联合会（以下简称“联合会”）者，应当向内政安全部长提交下列各款所列文件。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n1. 载明发起人姓名、出生日期、地址和简介的文件（如果发起人是公司，则需提供载明公司名称、主要办公地点以及其代表姓名、出生日期、地址和简介的文件）\n2. 公司章程（1份）\n3. 资产清单和证明文件各一份，以及，如果申请出资，则需提供证明出资事实的文件。\n4. 相关财政年度的商业计划书和收支预算一份\n5. 拟任官员的姓名、出生日期、地址和个人简介文件一份，以及接受任命书一份。\n6. 成立大会会议记录（如果发起人是公司，则需提供证明公司成立决议的文件）1份\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":726,"end":1020,"target_id":"fac44a16eca8922ddcb71c778cb259eb8535d882cbe2159214c0ee8fd61394df","source_hash":"629445d8e921e557c461ca523ac4b89f1fd91c884e67093d3bd5eb071e749349","text":"第四条（章程中应规定的事项）根据本法第四条第六款的规定，本联合会的章程中应规定的事项如下：\n1. 目的\n2. 名称\n3. 办公室位置\n4. 业务描述\n5. 会员资格\n6. 关于成员的接纳、退出或除名的事项\n7. 股东大会和董事会的组成和决议\n8. 官员人数、任期和选举方式\n9. 关于费用负担的事项\n10. 财政年度\n11. 关于盈余处置和损失处理的事项\n12. 累计资金和储备金的数额及累计方法\n13. 存续期限或解散理由\n14. 关于公告方式的事项\n15. 关于修改公司章程的事项\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1020,"end":1071,"target_id":"ec7284e183bb5ffcae695d8dd55775d5463d70e2890124218a3405ff63fe9afd","source_hash":"153c009f26b26ac8af3a2081a21e02e24b76c961a14fa7efe8de426507cf7833","text":"补充规定 <第18436号，2004年6月22日>\n\n本法令自2004年6月23日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1071,"end":1113,"target_id":"f4e4148de6b75d24b4c6e2ff18e3921060e5cafda4c7d24fe18587d78430aed5","source_hash":"044e85cd01389ab8ecb6cca7abc7cbb6c18ecb4cba15c33e90724344aa05b2a2","text":"增补（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第20741号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1113,"end":1150,"target_id":"cd0e3bf224955aa666ac1d545e7fc72cbf7dedeb7fdf2b6ecc2caa2e691243c7","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1150,"end":1167,"target_id":"5584a2654914f0d43716e6c763abf4281a0dba332a0c4759fb78179308a6246e","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1167,"end":1241,"target_id":"96cb7008fec0050cd678139d3dcb4b1bbe4d44e60458243cd474f144f7a300f3","source_hash":"be8a204a93eb74b616043d65b646768fa014b1fe025174c991c8aac760283bc2","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<98> 已省略\n\n  <99> 《支持专业人士经济活动法》实施细则部分内容修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1241,"end":1311,"target_id":"25259a3b90ad4837811cc0502e4871e2c45d45817935df7dbf28a9ca04fe437f","source_hash":"1b809cfe746b9e9de3d1ee705818eb3a20d4666a224e8e2a59089653514c30b0","text":"  除第3条各款外，其余部分“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“内政和安全部长”。\n\n  <100> 至 <105> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1311,"end":1355,"target_id":"17b1d698a18d43125414cd5b1a8c1d894e5505629ffbd2de880d736919d4af2c","source_hash":"508e4d9f0662bfe15e03f42c25de757851317af3534e8dbc91e5021f67d7d506","text":"补充规定 <第23854号，2012年6月15日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1355,"end":1397,"target_id":"5aedf09a489b3c5fc763ce3739b1629908d4e359916df6ce94f4e6c5aa6da252","source_hash":"875ab8aee4a83235873b291162119cdb344d6ba8382803dc8137e33dcb11d458","text":"ADDEND（安全与公共管理部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2013年3月23日，第24425号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1397,"end":1522,"target_id":"d0ff71c57cbc6d3fb6ad1cc7fd3e368d04b33a7e2c7f4e50c6679e78d18e2bd9","source_hash":"43029911dc2de8ee3c18d3a0db5ea54e4a90b52bf432a54ad38d3946d19ff180","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第六条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1522,"end":1539,"target_id":"21068aa6a01aec36c4e6ad5d03bda2092f3c38bb8f23f8d8da96fa8121847bda","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1539,"end":1619,"target_id":"8044ef47393bfe99fb73b9d26d8e60f4dfef87794dd1bba8ba54cff56b634ef9","source_hash":"b7ebdd5fb67c4c83d5c1585d972f9ebc818ecff6d94b046801684d7ea6298e14","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<119>款已省略\n\n  《支持专业人士经济活动法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00017","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1619,"end":1687,"target_id":"c81aaf76bfb825574061416446c67df99f3ef8519a4f4525a61f975be75a1f46","source_hash":"88828915ac819e392b16a4d9d0c1373cf42da3149de056650fb19fbc69a56b1a","text":"  除第3条各款外，其余部分“公共行政和安全部长”应改为“安全保障部长”。\n\n  <121> 至 <129> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00018","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1687,"end":1730,"target_id":"0df7515c3a6efd2aeaa2c4818342a186ef58c3f4188d06837bf07e29690a880a","source_hash":"a3c47358b5319a3ba45787da785dfea890df8d8d79398cc9047d30e04f9d9dac","text":"ADDEND（政府行政和内政部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2014年11月19日，第25751号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00019","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1730,"end":1855,"target_id":"5fcef2923f33f374f93233613c9759360695d5de4c5163c494a986e004fd5e35","source_hash":"ecc5937743f918230a397055273a1cd44275217a8341699c9b3693e458eb6e4c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第五条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00020","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-009721-195667-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1855,"end":1872,"target_id":"838eeaf0d546fe7a06fad10566fa9d78421b2b94d38329aa8fa1df8bb1bb9ee8","source_hash":"6ffda08faf1